{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17195","headline":"奉和新卜城南郊居得与卫右丞邻舍因赋诗寄赠 · 权德舆","name":"奉和新卜城南郊居得与卫右丞邻舍因赋诗寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上宰坐论道，郊居仍里仁。\n六符既昭晰，万象随陶钧。\n旭旦下玉墀，鸣驺拂车茵。\n轩窗退残暑，风物迎萧辰。\n山泽蜃雨出，林塘鱼鸟驯。\n岂同求羊迳，共是羲皇人。\n石君五曹重，左户三壤均。\n居止烟火接，逢迎鸡黍频。\n大方本无隅，盛德必有邻。\n千年郢曲後，复此闻阳春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}